    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Brew a delicious tea and embark on a distant adventure filled with retrofuturistic spirit, on the space station \u0421itytone, where you will uncover the secrets of the enigmatic Ancient race and aid those left onboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508560/extras/0b56380a70f421105543704dd47b0e97.poster.avif?t=1724190871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508560/extras/0b56380a70f421105543704dd47b0e97.webm?t=1724190871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508560/extras/0b56380a70f421105543704dd47b0e97.mp4?t=1724190871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>New characters and thrilling adventures await you, featuring puzzles and mini-games accompanied by delightful music.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508560/extras/dbae7321320dc36c1f55a7ef7234d618.poster.avif?t=1724190871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508560/extras/dbae7321320dc36c1f55a7ef7234d618.webm?t=1724190871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508560/extras/dbae7321320dc36c1f55a7ef7234d618.mp4?t=1724190871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But be cautious, as the robot Lekto is lurking somewhere in the shadows...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508560/extras/c749a182c5b877be8abd555e1de9f81d.avif?t=1724190871\" /></span>",
